rd}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\land\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\land\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：取前提的同一 T,h，根标注满足 h(r)≤α≤β，所有其余条件不变。结论只提高上界，不声称最小实际树高发生变化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-height-bound","status":"resolved","id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-height-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-height-bound","status":"resolved","id":"dd8d54af84f6f7dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"按 [[18-df-proof-height-bound]] 固定 $\\mathcal P,s$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P,s","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\land\\mathcal P\\vdash^\\alpha s\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P\\vdash^\\beta s.","display":true}],"bytes":954,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-proof-height-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"6808c2b04eb4fb44","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","元数据 · canonical_document","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"本文件是 [[18-thm-proof-height-monotonicity]] 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-proof-height-monotonicity]]"}],"outgoing":["dd8d54af84f6